      "label": "squirrel contemplating life",
      "description": "A gray and brown squirrel is lying relaxed on a curved tree branch, appearing contemplative. The scene is framed with text overlay that anthropomorphizes the squirrel's posture as existential confusion. The squirrel is the central participant, positioned horizontally across the branch, with the tree trunk forming a natural backdrop. The text elements are positioned above and below the squirrel, framing its 'thoughtful' state.",
