      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "self_deprecating_humor",
      "label": "Self-deprecating humor",
      "description": "A form of humor where the subject makes fun of themselves, often to appear humble or relatable. This meme uses the squirrel as a stand-in for the viewer, allowing the audience to laugh at their own life uncertainties without feeling attacked.",
