      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general audience of internet users who can relate to the concept of existential confusion and self-deprecating humor. The anthropomorphized squirrel serves as a universal stand-in for any person experiencing life uncertainty, making it accessible to anyone familiar with internet meme culture.",
